@Solar_HostAddress = http://localhost:5031

### Check Ingestion Status and Database Counts
GET {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/status
Accept: application/json

###

### Trigger Immediate Telemetry Sync On-Demand
POST {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/sync-now
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Latest Instantaneous Telemetry Reading
GET {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/telemetry/latest
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Telemetry History for Last 24 Hours
GET {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/telemetry/history
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Consolidated Daily Energy and Grid Uptime Metrics
GET {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/metrics/daily
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Consolidated Monthly Energy and Grid Uptime Metrics
GET {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/metrics/monthly
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Monthly Energy Metrics for a Specific Year
GET {{Solar_HostAddress}}/api/solar/metrics/monthly?year=2026
Accept: application/json

###
